story_text = Array[String](["This integrated dataset combines synchrotron X-ray microtomography ($\\mu$CT) and non-destructive neutron radiography to investigate the internal microstructure and fluid transport properties of ancient Roman concrete drilled from the \"Hospitium\" in Pompeii. High-resolution 3D XCT imaging enables the precise extraction and quantitative analysis of internal architectural features—including three-dimensional crack propagation networks, pore size distributions, pore orientations, and matrix tortuosity and connectivity.", "Simultaneously, neutron radiography is deployed to track and visually quantify real-time water distribution and absorptivity through the material's complex pore networks, including the specific impact of mechanically induced cracks.", "By pairing structural X-ray datasets with dynamic neutron imaging, this dual-method characterization clarifies how the microstructural engineering of ancient materials directly governs their macroscopic moisture movement, durability, and resistance to environmental degradation over thousands of years."])

